Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_fax3.c
Line: 1691
Function: Fax4Encode
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: Uses cc % sp->b.rowbytes without verifying sp->b.rowbytes != 0. A zero rowbytes (e.g., zero-width image) will cause a division by zero during encoding.

